            <div xml:id="d595">

                <pb facs="1429" n="1413" sameAs="frus:frus1951v01/pg1413"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">394.31/9–1251: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United States</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">GATT</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Delegation to the Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-09-21">September 21,
                        1951</date>—noon.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Tagg 19. Re Embtel 1296, repeated Geneva 9. UK, substantial number other dels
                    have agreed support US proposal for severance GATT relations with Czech. Still talking to Fr and agreement
                    believed very near. For your information Schuman has promised Secy Fr wld
                    reconsider their earlier opposition. Wld appreciate continued Emb help in obtaining satisfactory instructions to
                    Ital del.</p>
                <p>Sent Rome 9, rptd info Dept Tagg 19.</p>
            </div>
